@* Reusable card, shared across Credify pages — shows that bundled plugins can be structured with their
   own component library, not just single flat pages. Tailwind utilities + a host design token. *@
<div class="rounded-lg bg-zinc-800/60 p-4 ring-1 ring-white/5">
    <div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-zinc-400">@Title</div>
    <div class="mt-1 text-2xl font-bold text-[color:var(--color-action-primary,#818cf8)]">@Value</div>
</div>
